                <pb facs="0565" n="421" xml:id="pg421"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">861.77 Chinese Eastern/679: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Chargé in Switzerland</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Moffat</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1929-12-13T17:00:00-05:00">December 13, 1929—5
                        p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>143. Your 118, December 10, 6 p.m., last two paragraphs. I appreciate Mr. Motta’s
                    desire to be helpful and would be gratified if he would make public a
                        communiqué.<anchor n="8" xml:id="d383-f1"/></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
